+The method relies on creating "Slab Silhouette Maps" (SSM) from texture slabs to identify empty spaces and terminated rays, storing this information in the depth buffer [S1, unofficial]. The algorithm proceeds in three main phases: data preparation, silhouette map generation, and ray casting.
 
